          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Get ready for a groovy kinda Christmas that you'll be playing on repeat all season long! Jingle Jams delivers a festive soundtrack where classic holiday tunes are reworked with a modern flair, and brand-new original songs become instant favorites.  \n\nThis album is a non-stop \"Party at The North Pole,\" featuring fresh, upbeat takes on timeless classics like \"Deck The Halls\" and \"The 12 Days of Christmas.\" These are mixed with unforgettable new hits like \"Reindeer (Down To Earth)\" and the heartfelt \"Santa Don't Forget About Me.\" It’s the perfect blend of nostalgic cheer and contemporary beats, creating a joyful and exciting listening experience for children and families all around the world. Let the new holiday traditions begin!",
